<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .label {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt;">FACULTY PERFORMANCE REPORT FOR LIBRARY AND EDUCATIONAL TECHNOLOGY SERVICES FACULTY</h2>
      <p style="margin-top: 5px;">Academic Period</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <span data-field="appendix_id">{{ appendix_id }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p>NAME: <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></p>
    <p>Rank: <span data-field="rank">{{ rank }}</span></p>
    <p>#Years Full-Time: <span data-field="years_full_time">{{ years_full_time }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p>DEPARTMENT: <span data-field="department">{{ department }}</span></p>
    <p>List Current Duties/Assignments: <span data-field="current_duties">{{ current_duties }}</span></p>
    <p>Additional Assignments (professorship, grant, release-time, etc.): <span data-field="additional_assignments">{{ additional_assignments }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p>I. What were your professional goals this year as related to departmental performance guidelines?</p>
    <p>Professional Effectiveness: <span data-field="goals_professional_effectiveness_i">{{ goals_professional_effectiveness_i }}</span></p>
    <p>Research, Scholarship, and Other Creative Activities: <span data-field="goals_research_scholarship_i">{{ goals_research_scholarship_i }}</span></p>
    <p>University, Community, and Professional Service: <span data-field="goals_university_community_i">{{ goals_university_community_i }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p>II. What was accomplished relative to these goals?</p>
    <p>Professional Effectiveness: <span data-field="accomplishments_professional_effectiveness_ii">{{ accomplishments_professional_effectiveness_ii }}</span></p>
    <p>Research, Scholarship, and Other Creative Activities: <span data-field="accomplishments_research_scholarship_ii">{{ accomplishments_research_scholarship_ii }}</span></p>
    <p>University, Community, and Professional Service: <span data-field="accomplishments_university_community_ii">{{ accomplishments_university_community_ii }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p>III. After evaluating your goals/accomplishments for the current year, indicate your measurable goals/objectives for the upcoming year.</p>
    <p>Professional Effectiveness: <span data-field="future_goals_professional_effectiveness_iii">{{ future_goals_professional_effectiveness_iii }}</span></p>
    <p>Research, Scholarship, and Other Creative Activities: <span data-field="future_goals_research_scholarship_iii">{{ future_goals_research_scholarship_iii }}</span></p>
    <p>University, Community, and Professional Service: <span data-field="future_goals_university_community_iii">{{ future_goals_university_community_iii }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p>IV. Evaluation by supervisor related to departmental performance guidelines (to be completed annually by September 15 for non-tenured faculty and every two years for tenured faculty).</p>
    <p>Professional Effectiveness: <span data-field="supervisor_evaluation_professional_effectiveness_iv">{{ supervisor_evaluation_professional_effectiveness_iv }}</span></p>
    <p>Research, Scholarship, and Other Creative Activities: <span data-field="supervisor_evaluation_research_scholarship_iv">{{ supervisor_evaluation_research_scholarship_iv }}</span></p>
    <p>University, Community, and Professional Service: <span data-field="supervisor_evaluation_university_community_iv">{{ supervisor_evaluation_university_community_iv }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <p>Faculty Member Signature</p>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
        <p>Date</p>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 50px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <p>Supervisor Signature</p>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
        <p>Date</p>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 50px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 45%;">
        <p>Dean Signature</p>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
        <p>Date</p>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top: 50px;">Optional Comments by Dean: <span data-field="dean_comments">{{ dean_comments }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: 100px; font-size: 10pt;">*Attach updated vita per Faculty Handbook</p>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <span data-field="page_number">{{ page_number }}</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
    <span data-field="page_number">{{ page_number }}</span>
  </div>
</div>